# Implementation Plan - Phase 2: UI/UX Design System

# Goal Description
Establish a "Premium" and "Canada-First" design system for Spendigo SmartCart. This includes defining the visual tokens (Color, Typography, Spacing), creating the global CSS architecture, and designing high-fidelity wireframes for critical flows (Onboarding, Cart, Checkout).
**Constraint Checklist**:
- [x] Vanilla CSS (No Tailwind unless requested - User did NOT request).
- [x] WCAG 2.1 AA Compliance.
- [x] Bilingual Support (EN/FR) readiness in layout.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Aesthetics**:
> The prompt requires "Rich Aesthetics", "Vibrant Colors", and "Glassmorphism".
> I will generate a **Mood Board** image and a **CSS Variables** file to demonstrate this direction.

> [!WARNING]
> **Accessibility vs Aesthetics**:
> Glassmorphism can sometimes have contrast issues. I will ensure all text overlays meet the 4.5:1 ratio required by WCAG AA.

